      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gribouille semble fasciné par la Diancite.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047007200690062006F00750069006C006C0065002000730065006D0062006C0065002000660061007300630069006E00E900200070006100720020006C00610020004400690061006E0063006900740065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Psysti ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050007300790073007400690020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grigri !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720069006700720069002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai l’impression que Gribouille a capté un\nmessage télépathique...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A2019006100690020006C20190069006D007000720065007300730069006F006E002000710075006500200047007200690062006F00750069006C006C0065002000610020006300610070007400E900200075006E000A006D0065007300730061006700650020007400E9006C00E900700061007400680069007100750065002E002E002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En fait, il est capable de transmettre les pensées\nd’une personne à une autre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Normalement, je préfère qu’il évite de le faire,\ncar ça le fatigue beaucoup...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n... mais parfois, ça lui arrive sans crier gare.\nComme maintenant !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 154
    },
    {
      "displayText": "N’empêche, ça m’intrigue... Est-ce qu’il aurait\ncapté des souvenirs qui sont dans la Diancite ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>... Suivons Gribouille et\nvoyons où ça nous mène !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C0065007A002C00200010000201000000002E002E002E00200053007500690076006F006E007300200047007200690062006F00750069006C006C0065002000650074000A0076006F0079006F006E00730020006F00F9002000E700610020006E006F007500730020006D00E8006E00650020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je crois qu’il capte quelque chose...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000630072006F0069007300200071007520190069006C0020006300610070007400650020007100750065006C007100750065002000630068006F00730065002E002E002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attends deux secondes...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007400740065006E00640073002000640065007500780020007300650063006F006E006400650073002E002E002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allô ? Roxie ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C00F40020003F00200052006F0078006900650020003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis en mission avec Gribouille, mais j’aurais\npeut-être besoin d’un coup de main.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui. Contacte Mitzi et Hohneck pour moi,\ns’il te plaît.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750069002E00200043006F006E007400610063007400650020004D00690074007A006900200065007400200048006F0068006E00650063006B00200070006F007500720020006D006F0069002C000A007320190069006C00200074006500200070006C006100EE0074002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Désolée pour l’attente. J’ai prévenu quelques\nvieilles connaissances.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400E90073006F006C00E9006500200070006F007500720020006C20190061007400740065006E00740065002E0020004A20190061006900200070007200E900760065006E00750020007100750065006C0071007500650073000A0076006900650069006C006C0065007300200063006F006E006E00610069007300730061006E006300650073002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "De vieilles connaissances ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006500200076006900650069006C006C0065007300200063006F006E006E00610069007300730061006E0063006500730020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu les connais comment ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400750020006C0065007300200063006F006E006E00610069007300200063006F006D006D0065006E00740020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est ça d’être à la tête d’une agence de détectives.\nBon, c’est celle de Monsieur Beladonis à la base...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "D’où le nom « Agence Beladonis » ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00442019006F00F90020006C00650020006E006F006D002000AB0020004100670065006E00630065002000420065006C00610064006F006E00690073002000BB0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est lui qui a donné son nom à l’agence ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004320190065007300740020006C0075006900200071007500690020006100200064006F006E006E00E900200073006F006E0020006E006F006D002000E00020006C2019006100670065006E006300650020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tout à fait ! Il était très gentil.\nC’est lui qui m’a appris les ficelles du métier.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais il était aussi dans la police internationale.\nIl a été muté loin pour régler une autre affaire...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Depuis, je fais de mon mieux pour le remplacer,\navec l’aide de Gribouille et de quelques potes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gribouille est télépathe et il m’a bien épaulé\npour régler tout un tas d’affaires complexes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais comme je te disais, il s’épuise s’il utilise\ntrop ses pouvoirs.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610069007300200063006F006D006D00650020006A00650020007400650020006400690073006100690073002C00200069006C00200073201900E9007000750069007300650020007320190069006C0020007500740069006C006900730065000A00740072006F0070002000730065007300200070006F00750076006F006900720073002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grigri ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047007200690067007200690020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Psy !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500073007900200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vite ! Suivons-le !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560069007400650020002100200053007500690076006F006E0073002D006C00650020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gribouille ! Tu as lu mes pensées ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047007200690062006F00750069006C006C0065002000210020005400750020006100730020006C00750020006D00650073002000700065006E007300E9006500730020003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Serait-ce le pouvoir de Gribouille ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300650072006100690074002D006300650020006C006500200070006F00750076006F0069007200200064006500200047007200690062006F00750069006C006C00650020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous entendez les pensées de Millie...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n...\n...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n« Gribouille... Qu’est-ce qui lui arrive... ?\nHmmm... Je commence à avoir la dalle, moi... »<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n...\n...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 157
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Millie ? Ça va ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0069006C006C006900650020003F002000C700610020007600610020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu as faim ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400750020006100730020006600610069006D0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ha ha, oui ! J’ai un petit creux !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061002000680061002C0020006F00750069002000210020004A20190061006900200075006E0020007000650074006900740020006300720065007500780020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Psypsy.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000730079007000730079002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci, Gribouille.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065007200630069002C00200047007200690062006F00750069006C006C0065002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allons nous ravitailler !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C006F006E00730020006E006F0075007300200072006100760069007400610069006C006C006500720020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, je me sens mieux !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C0020006A00650020006D0065002000730065006E00730020006D00690065007500780020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maintenant, montre-nous où tu voulais aller,\nGribouille.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610069006E00740065006E0061006E0074002C0020006D006F006E007400720065002D006E006F007500730020006F00F900200074007500200076006F0075006C00610069007300200061006C006C00650072002C000A0047007200690062006F00750069006C006C0065002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Psysti ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050007300790073007400690020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Psygri !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 4932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500073007900670072006900200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Suivons-le !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 4956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007500690076006F006E0073002D006C00650020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 4992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’y a-t-il, Gribouille ?\nIl t’intrigue, cet Holoporteur ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019007900200061002D0074002D0069006C002C00200047007200690062006F00750069006C006C00650020003F000A0049006C0020007420190069006E007400720069006700750065002C002000630065007400200048006F006C006F0070006F007200740065007500720020003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grigri...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720069006700720069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Psygri !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500073007900670072006900200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu veux aller là-haut ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 5176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400750020007600650075007800200061006C006C006500720020006C00E0002D00680061007500740020003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gri !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 5232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470072006900200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je crois qu’on n’est pas loin !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 5248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000630072006F006900730020007100752019006F006E0020006E201900650073007400200070006100730020006C006F0069006E0020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On t’attend en haut !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 5320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E0020007420190061007400740065006E006400200065006E002000680061007500740020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿4",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 5372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est ici que tu sentais quelque chose ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 5384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200069006300690020007100750065002000740075002000730065006E00740061006900730020007100750065006C007100750065002000630068006F007300650020003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Griiii !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 5476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470072006900690069006900200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il y a beaucoup trop de Méga-cristaux ici.\nC’est louche...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 5500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C0020007900200061002000620065006100750063006F00750070002000740072006F00700020006400650020004D00E900670061002D006300720069007300740061007500780020006900630069002E000A004320190065007300740020006C006F0075006300680065002E002E002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Psygri gri !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 5628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000730079006700720069002000670072006900200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Des Strassie ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 5660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006500730020005300740072006100730073006900650020003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et aussi... un autre Pokémon...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 5700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450074002000610075007300730069002E002E002E00200075006E00200061007500740072006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002E002E002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Peut-être qu’il a un lien avec ta Méga-Gemme ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 5772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500750074002D00EA00740072006500200071007520190069006C0020006100200075006E0020006C00690065006E002000610076006500630020007400610020004D00E900670061002D00470065006D006D00650020003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Psy !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 5876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500073007900200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour en avoir le cœur net, il va falloir l’attraper !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 5892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0075007200200065006E002000610076006F006900720020006C0065002000630153007500720020006E00650074002C00200069006C002000760061002000660061006C006C006F006900720020006C2019006100740074007200610070006500720020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Psygrigri.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 6008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000730079006700720069006700720069002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 6032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Diaaa !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 6044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006900610061006100200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿A",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 6064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu dois absolument l’attraper !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 6076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200064006F006900730020006100620073006F006C0075006D0065006E00740020006C2019006100740074007200610070006500720020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu dois l’attraper, et non pas le battre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 6148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200064006F006900730020006C201900610074007400720061007000650072002C0020006500740020006E006F006E00200070006100730020006C006500200062006100740074007200650020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bravo ! T’es toujours aussi doué<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 6244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007200610076006F002000210020005420190065007300200074006F0075006A006F00750072007300200061007500730073006900200064006F007500E900100003110000FF010000650020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Montre-moi le Pokémon que tu viens d’attraper...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 6336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F006E007400720065002D006D006F00690020006C006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200071007500650020007400750020007600690065006E007300200064201900610074007400720061007000650072002E002E002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, qu’il est joli... !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 6444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200071007520190069006C00200065007300740020006A006F006C0069002E002E002E0020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il brille comme le Cadran Solaire de Flusselles !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 6500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C0020006200720069006C006C006500200063006F006D006D00650020006C0065002000430061006400720061006E00200053006F006C006100690072006500200064006500200046006C0075007300730065006C006C006500730020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Flusselles ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 6608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006C0075007300730065006C006C006500730020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un cadran solaire ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 6636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E002000630061006400720061006E00200073006F006C00610069007200650020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Flusselles est une ville célèbre pour son étrange\ncadran solaire.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCertains pensent qu’il a un lien avec\nles Méga-Gemmes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 6676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai des tas d’hypothèses qui me viennent...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 6932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190061006900200064006500730020007400610073002000642019006800790070006F0074006800E800730065007300200071007500690020006D00650020007600690065006E006E0065006E0074002E002E002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu sais, depuis que Monsieur Beladonis est parti,\nj’ai fait plein de nouvelles rencontres...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 7032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Déjà, Monsieur A.Z.\nEt aussi, le Professeur Platane.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 7228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400E9006A00E0002C0020004D006F006E0073006900650075007200200041002E005A002E000A00450074002000610075007300730069002C0020006C0065002000500072006F006600650073007300650075007200200050006C006100740061006E0065002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est un spécialiste de la Méga-Évolution.\nD’ailleurs, il parlait souvent avec Monsieur A.Z.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 7344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sa théorie sur l’origine des Méga-Gemmes était\nqu’il y a 3 000 ans, des pierres se seraient<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nimprégnées de la « lumière » de l’arme suprême...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nAutrement dit, l’énergie de Pokémon légendaires.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 7540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 201
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Monsieur A.Z. avait l’air d’accord avec ça.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nD’après lui, c’est pour cela qu’on trouve de\nnouveaux types de Méga-Gemmes, dernièrement.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 80,
      "offsetInSection": 7944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... Parce que quelqu’un a utilisé l’arme suprême\nil y a cinq ans.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 8228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E00200050006100720063006500200071007500650020007100750065006C0071007520190075006E002000610020007500740069006C0069007300E90020006C201900610072006D00650020007300750070007200EA006D0065000A0069006C0020007900200061002000630069006E007100200061006E0073002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Psygriii...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 8368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500073007900670072006900690069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ne crains rien, Gribouille ! On est là pour protéger\nIllumis, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> et moi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 8392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>... Prends bien soin de\nce Pokémon, d’accord ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 84,
      "offsetInSection": 8552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450074002C00200010000201000000002E002E002E0020005000720065006E006400730020006200690065006E00200073006F0069006E002000640065000A0063006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002C002000642019006100630063006F007200640020003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Illumis a besoin de gens comme toi, qui peuvent\ntisser des liens avec plein de Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 8672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, bye. Je rentre à l’agence.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 86,
      "offsetInSection": 8856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C0065007A002C0020006200790065002E0020004A0065002000720065006E007400720065002000E00020006C2019006100670065006E00630065002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, attends ! Je repense à quelque chose !\nMonsieur A.Z. avait rapporté un truc surprenant...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 8932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pendant son long voyage pour retrouver Floette,\nil aurait visité Hoenn, une région très loin d’ici.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIl a dit que là-bas, il aurait assisté au phénomène\nqui a donné naissance à la Méga-Évolution !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 9128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 203
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est sans doute pour ça qu’il pensait sans arrêt\naux liens entre nous et les Pokémon...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 9536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, je m’en vais pour de vrai, cette fois.\nJe t’appelle si j’ai une autre affaire corsée ! Bye !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 9724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    }
  ],
